cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reconstruction pseudocode, please cite the associated CAC-QPI manuscript described in preferred-citation and this repository."
title: "CAC-QPI Experimental Reconstruction Pseudocode"
abstract: "Detailed end-to-end pseudocode and parameter definitions for the experimental CAC-QPI reconstruction of quantitative phase from two symmetric-defocus images and two weighted multiplexed off-axis illumination images."
